{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendOwnVerification()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"metadata":{"title":"resendOwnVerification()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resendOwnVerification"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC21resendOwnVerificationyyYaKF"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/api\/v1\/users\/me\/resend-verification"},{"type":"text","text":" (CONTRACT.md §25.1, §25.7) — resend the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"signed-in caller’s own","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" verification mail, and say what happened."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resendOwnVerification","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Takes no address. The server reads it off the caller’s own record, and this signature","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deliberately offers no way to name a different one: a parameter here would let an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"authenticated session mail an arbitrary address.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unlike "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendVerification(email:tenantID:)"},{"type":"text","text":" this reports the outcome, because the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"caller is signed in to the account it is asking about and none of the outcomes tells"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it anything it did not already bring with it:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"returns — a token was minted and the mail "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"enqueued"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Delivery is asynchronous"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and can still fail at the provider; a queue that accepts everything in front of a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provider that rejects it looks exactly like this succeeding (§25.7 rule 3)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"AxiamError.authz","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"409","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") — already verified, or an account state that must","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not be sent a live token.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AxiamError.network"},{"text":" (from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"429"},{"text":") — the daily resend limit.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"§25.7 rule 2 forbids falling back to the unauthenticated endpoint on either failure,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and this SDK does not: that fallback turns both back into a silent success and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"restores the bug this operation exists to fix, with an extra round trip.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Refused client-side with "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"no wire call"}]},{"type":"text","text":" when there is no session."}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/resendownverification()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient":{"title":"AxiamClient","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The AXIAM REST client (§1–§7, §9 of CONTRACT.md)."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AxiamClient"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AxiamClient"}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/resendVerification(email:tenantID:)":{"abstract":[{"code":"POST \/api\/v1\/auth\/resend-verification","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (CONTRACT.md §25.1) — the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"unauthenticated"}]},{"text":" resend, for a caller with no session.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"resendVerification(email:tenantID:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendVerification(email:tenantID:)","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/resendverification(email:tenantid:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resendVerification"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"email"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tenantID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"title":"AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/resendOwnVerification()":{"kind":"symbol","title":"resendOwnVerification()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resendOwnVerification"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"code":"POST \/api\/v1\/users\/me\/resend-verification","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (CONTRACT.md §25.1, §25.7) — resend the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"signed-in caller’s own"}]},{"text":" verification mail, and say what happened.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/resendownverification()","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendOwnVerification()","role":"symbol"}}}